Hi

The lm80 driver is wrong one.
You have another chip called via686a.
Unfortunately it is presented only on SMBus.
You need to present it on ISA bus.
Look to /proc/ioports file.
Check if you have region 6000 free.
Then do following commands:

rmmod lm80
modprobe i2c-isa
modprobe via686a force_adr=0x06000
sensors

